      "content": "This override supplies data that the production Detail builder never emits: `getTradeDetail` constructs the Open view without `marksColumns`, and its only production occurrence is the optional type declaration. Consequently, real Open Trades reach `marksOf` without dates and display undated headings and dashes even when the replay has Marks, while this test passes. Add coverage using a production-built Detail and wire up the column dates before relying on this synthetic fixture for the dated-table assertion.",
