      "content": "The production Detail view never populates `marksColumns`: `getTradeDetail` returns the Open view with `current` but no column dates, and the only assignments in this tree are in test fixtures. Consequently both session lookups here receive `undefined`, so every Open Trade now displays undated headings and dashes even when replay Marks are available. Please wire the A232 date producer into the production view before switching to this selector (and cover the real producer-to-drawer path rather than only injecting dates in tests).",
